      },
      "engagement": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "17900015757535553",
      "text": "Dhuha itu aku sering skip pas \"ngerasa baik-baik aja\" — dan baru balik pas lagi butuh banget.\nPadahal sekarang aku nyada",
      "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@_iame.hijrah/post/DbqCWPonGFC",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-05T11:31:29+0000",
